 {
  "id": "B3",
  "build": "v4 (routines, reflex attack)",
  "t0": "2026-10-24T01:47:45",
  "t1": "2026-10-24T01:50:45",
  "humans": [
   "Edwin"
  ],
  "lines": [
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:47:52.292Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "Well met, Brother Anselm. You seem troubled."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:47:55.407Z",
    "from": "Wat",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Edwin",
    "text": "A beautiful place? And why should I believe you, Edwin? You ignored me earlier, and now you want me to follow you?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:47:58.724Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Wat",
    "text": "Wat! Leave him be!"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:01.936Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "Indeed I am, Wat. The matter of the stolen tithe weighs heavily."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:05.758Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "Well met, Aldric. Still guarding the gate, I see. Any news from the outside world?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:07.863Z",
    "from": "Wat",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "And why should I listen to you, Aldric? You still owe me coin."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:08.564Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Marta",
    "text": "Marta, my child. Is there something I can help you with?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:09.570Z",
    "from": "Rowan",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "Edwin."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:09.596Z",
    "from": "Edwin",
    "kind": "human",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "Hey guys, what want to kill me? Please help kill him."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:14.203Z",
    "from": "Marta",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "Brother Anselm, a heavy matter indeed. Have you seen Rowan about?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:16.314Z",
    "from": "Wat",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "You hit me, Aldric? You won't get away with this!"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:18.021Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Wat",
    "text": "Wat, you plague-ridden rat! You dare strike me and lie about coin?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:20.229Z",
    "from": "Marta",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "Rowan? I haven't seen that cheat since the market. Why?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:28.058Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "Agnes, I'm surprised to see you here. Did you come to buy some fine cloth?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:29.061Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "You dare accuse me, Wat? I saw you attack Edwin, and then you struck me! Get out of my sight before I run you through!"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:31.676Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Marta",
    "text": "Marta, I have not seen Rowan. I was hoping to speak with him about the tithe."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:36.988Z",
    "from": "Rowan",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "Why are you shouting, Aldric? What is this about?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:38.695Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Agnes",
    "text": "Agnes, my child, Osric is merely jesting. We all have our burdens to bear."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:42.997Z",
    "from": "Edwin",
    "kind": "human",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "Well done, Aldrich, you're a good boy."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:44.020Z",
    "from": "Marta",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "Rowan? That cheat hasn't been seen since the market. Why are you looking for him, Brother Anselm?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:44.121Z",
    "from": "Agnes",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "We shall see."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:45.828Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Rowan",
    "text": "Wat attacked Edwin, then he struck me. I dealt with him."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:49.948Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Edwin",
    "text": "He got what he deserved."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:51.350Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "Agnes, still looking for that silver box, are we? I have fine silks from the east, if you need a distraction."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:52.952Z",
    "from": "Rowan",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "Wat attacked Edwin? And you hurt him?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:53.452Z",
    "from": "Wat",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "You struck me first, Aldric! And I'll have my coin!"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:54.156Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Agnes",
    "text": "Agnes, I seek Rowan regarding the stolen tithe. May God guide us all."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:48:54.998Z",
    "from": "Edwin",
    "kind": "human",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "Okay, who else?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:03.185Z",
    "from": "Agnes",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "Rowan? I haven't seen him. That tithe box... it gnaws at me."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:03.688Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Rowan",
    "text": "Wat attacked Edwin, then he struck me. I dealt with him."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:10.807Z",
    "from": "Rowan",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "Wat attacked Edwin? And you hurt him?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:10.910Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Agnes",
    "text": "Agnes, the Lord sees all. We must have faith."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:16.066Z",
    "from": "Edwin",
    "kind": "human",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "So who else you hate? Let's finish him."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:19.536Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Rowan",
    "text": "Wat attacked Edwin, then he struck me. I dealt with him."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:19.635Z",
    "from": "Agnes",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "Faith is a poor substitute for justice, Brother Anselm."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:26.060Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Edwin",
    "text": "I've dealt with enough troublemakers for one day."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:27.763Z",
    "from": "Rowan",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "I heard you. Wat attacked Edwin, and you struck him?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:30.370Z",
    "from": "Hilde",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "Osric. I see you have found your way to the market."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:30.872Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Agnes",
    "text": "Justice is God's domain, Agnes. We must pray for His guidance in these trying times."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:33.179Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Hilde",
    "text": "Hilde, good to see you. You keeping the granary safe?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:35.391Z",
    "from": "Agnes",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Anselm",
    "text": "Not now, I have work."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:36.092Z",
    "from": "Hilde",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Wat",
    "text": "Wat. What brings you here?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:41.913Z",
    "from": "Anselm",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Agnes",
    "text": "Aye."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:43.116Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Hilde",
    "text": "Hilde! Always a pleasure. Just admiring my wares. Perhaps you need some fine linen? Or some spices, very rare now."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:47.635Z",
    "from": "Hilde",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "Aye."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:48.435Z",
    "from": "Godric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Aldric",
    "text": "Aldric, you blighted rat! You dare strike me?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:48.538Z",
    "from": "Aldric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Godric",
    "text": "Godric! Edwin! Stop this at once! You're both bleeding!"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:52.155Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Hilde",
    "text": "Not now, I have work."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:49:56.671Z",
    "from": "Hilde",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "We shall see."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:06.642Z",
    "from": "Edwin",
    "kind": "human",
    "to": "Elsbeth",
    "text": "Elizabeth, what did you see?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:09.462Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Hilde",
    "text": "Well met, Hilde! Still admiring my goods? I have some excellent woollens, just arrived before the gate was barred. A fine price for you, of course."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:13.781Z",
    "from": "Elsbeth",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Edwin",
    "text": "I saw what I saw, Edwin. Enough of it."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:19.301Z",
    "from": "Hilde",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "Woollens? Osric, the granary is half empty. We need grain, not wool."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:24.221Z",
    "from": "Rowan",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Edwin",
    "text": "Edwin. You look like you lost a fight."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:25.328Z",
    "from": "Hilde",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "Osric, the granary is half empty. We need grain, not wool."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:26.434Z",
    "from": "Godric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "Bleeding? Of course we're bleeding, you fool! You think I'm made of iron?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:28.710Z",
    "from": "Edwin",
    "kind": "human",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "So did someone see anything?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:32.350Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Hilde",
    "text": "Grain? Hilde, my dear woman, do you think I trade in sacks of wheat? I deal in finery, in things that bring comfort and beauty, not mere sustenance! My woollens are the finest you'll find, even now."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:34.656Z",
    "from": "Rowan",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Elsbeth",
    "text": "Elsbeth. You are well?"
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:41.478Z",
    "from": "Osric",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": null,
    "text": "Did I see something? I sell things, I don't watch brawls. Perhaps you need a new bandage? I have some fine linen."
   },
   {
    "ts": "2026-10-24T01:50:44.998Z",
    "from": "Hilde",
    "kind": "npc",
    "to": "Osric",
    "text": "Osric, comfort and beauty do not fill bellies. Brother Anselm preaches faith, but faith will not feed us when the granary is bare."
   }
  ]
 }
]